   "widgets_values": [
    "Professional model reference board, studio comp card layout, horizontal composition, light gray seamless studio backdrop, thin clean dividing lines, 8K ultra-detailed, photorealistic, real person, live-action photography, soft studio lighting, consistent lighting across all panels.\n\nLeft side: close-up beauty portrait of a gentle young woman, cold fair translucent skin, natural skin texture with visible pores, delicate facial features, light cool-toned makeup, light brown shoulder-length hair with wispy bangs, small silver earrings, 85mm lens, shallow depth of field.\n\nTop right: three FULL BODY photographs in one row — front view, side view, back view of the same woman, natural standing pose, arms relaxed at the sides. Camera pulled far back: the whole figure from the top of the head down to the SHOES is inside each panel, both shoes and both feet fully visible and not cropped, a strip of light gray floor is visible under the feet with a small soft contact shadow, clear empty space between the feet and the bottom edge of the panel. Thin gap between the three panels.\n\nBottom right: expression sheet, six facial expression bust shots of the same woman in two rows of three — calm, smile, shy, sad, surprised, laugh — same lighting, same framing, consistent identity, same face in every cell.\n\nOutfit: light blue-gray ribbed off-shoulder knit top, light blue slim jeans, white sneakers.\n\nTall slim woman, 9-head body proportions, long legs, fashion model proportions.\n\nSame face across every panel, consistent character appearance in all panels, sharp focus, high resolution, DSLR, commercial studio shoot."
   ],
